      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In 2021, ExxonMobil entered into an agreement to divest its assets in Chad. The transaction is expected to close in 2022.",
            "entity_name": "XOM Chad Asset Divestiture Agreement 2021",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Effective January 1, 2022, ExxonMobil no longer participates in the Qatar Liquefied Gas Company Limited (QG1) venture, representing 3.6 thousand net acres and 9.9 million tonnes per year gross liquefied natural gas capacity.",
            "entity_name": "XOM Qatar QG1 Venture Exit 2022",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In 2021, the Dutch Government further reduced Groningen gas extraction. The expectation is that Groningen will cease regular production in 2022.",
            "entity_name": "Netherlands Groningen Gas Field Regulatory Extraction Reduction",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "period": "FY2021",
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "At year-end 2021, approximately 6.3 billion oil-equivalent barrels (GOEB) of ExxonMobil's proved reserves were classified as proved undeveloped. This represents 34 percent of the 18.5 GOEB reported in proved reserves.",
            "entity_name": "XOM Worldwide Upstream",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "period": "FY2021",
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "ExxonMobil's year-end 2021 acreage holdings totaled 10.5 million net acres, of which 0.3 million net acres were offshore. ExxonMobil was active in areas onshore and offshore in the lower 48 states and in Alaska. Development activities continued on the Golden Pass liquefied natural gas export project.",
            "entity_name": "XOM United States Upstream Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "period": "FY2021",
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "During 2021, average net production at Kearl was about 251 thousand barrels per day. During 2021, approximately 2.4 billion barrels of bitumen at Kearl were added to proved reserves primarily as a result of an improved SEC price basis versus 2020.",
            "entity_name": "XOM Canada Other Americas Upstream Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_2"
            },
            "chunk_type": "risk_factor",
            "content": "In addition, proved reserves could be affected by an extended period of low prices which could reduce the level of the Corporation's capital spending and also impact our partners' capacity to fund their share of joint projects.",
            "entity_name": "ExxonMobil Proved Reserves Low-Price and Capital Spending Risk",
            "entity_type_entity": "Risk",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
